Paneflow Agent started from fx commit 1b1f9af1619de4dbf7b4a48a50bb11f77469e988
and has been modified since. Notable modifications:

- The product, command, configuration paths, environment variables, and
  identifiers are renamed from fx to pf (Paneflow Agent).
- Manual and automatic upgrades from fx release channels are disabled.
- pf builds and runs natively on Windows x86_64: profile and temp paths,
  private state, the console UI, command execution through Git Bash or
  PowerShell inside Job Objects, line-ending-preserving edits, and
  workspace containment are ported to Windows.

"fx" and "Vercel" are names of Vercel, Inc. They appear here only to describe
where this code comes from.
